<title>SOUTH AFRICA: BTR Dunlop pretax profit up 11 percent.</title>
<headline>BTR Dunlop pretax profit up 11 percent.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			 (million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)   65.1	vs   61.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)	     15.0	vs   41.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	 80.9	vs   73.3</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		 117.5     vs   106.2</p>
<p>    Tax		     36.5	vs   32.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		835.0     vs   803.6</p>
<p>Note: The final dividend has been provided at the same rate as last year until the Board of Directors has approved the final dividend. The 1996 dividend per ordinary share represents the interim dividend only.</p>
<p>Full name: BTR Dunlop Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom (+27 11 482-1003)</p>
